### Common Notes API - IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Run the Spring Boot app, then click the green run icon beside any request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@chapterId = LC5H0102
@noteId = 1

### Get active common notes by chapter
GET {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/chapter/{{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all common notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/common-notes
Accept: application/json

###

### Get common note by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/{{noteId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create common note
POST {{baseUrl}}/common-notes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "chapterId": "{{chapterId}}",
  "category": "Formula",
  "title": "Quadratic Formula",
  "content": null,
  "imageUrl": "/uploads/chapters/{{chapterId}}/notes/common/note_img_1234567890.png",
  "color": "#BBDEFB",
  "icon": "📚",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "isActive": true,
  "createdBy": 1
}

###

### Update common note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/{{noteId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Quadratic Formula",
  "content": null,
  "imageUrl": "/uploads/chapters/{{chapterId}}/notes/common/note_img_9876543210.png",
  "displayOrder": 2
}

###

### Deactivate common note
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/{{noteId}}/deactivate
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete common note
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/{{noteId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get distinct active categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/common-notes/categories
Accept: application/json